# The scheduler. WITHOUT THIS LINE FOUR THINGS SILENTLY NEVER HAPPEN:
#
#   hourly        listings past their expiry stay live for ever
#   daily 09:00   sellers are never warned that a listing is about to expire
#   daily 06:00   exchange rates are never refreshed
#   every 15 min  saved searches never match and no alert is ever sent
#
# None of them fail loudly. The app looks fine and the marketplace quietly
# stops working, so check this first when something "just stopped".
#
# Install:  sudo crontab -u forge -e   and paste the line below.
# Forge:    it adds this itself when the site is created. Verify it is there.
#
# Laravel's scheduler is run every minute and decides for itself what is due.

* * * * * cd /home/forge/api.autevo.mk/api && /usr/bin/php artisan schedule:run >> /dev/null 2>&1
